nnable gate. Ready for review on code; blocked on base/tooling\\n  for CR validation command 21 only.\\n\\n===REVIEWER===\\nIndependently review the immutable CR actually published by RUN-260910-cc2077 for TASK-260909-2ez769. Full existing task scope/AC: pinned AX v0.6.0 sections6.6,11.10.2/3, plus directly referenced normative Host Channel credential profile. Read producer results and all exact CR evidence. Review real supported production behavior for closed Config4/TrustStore input, issuance/enrollment/mapping/rotation/revocation/generation authorization, owner-only custody and atomic crash durability, exact-preview migration/apply/rollback and exclusion of secrets. Drive both positive and narrowing-negative paths. Do not substitute structural tests or caller assertions for supported authority facts.\\n\\nImportant scope/evidence bounds: producer references current normative text from origin/main but Story is on checkpoint c1eff01 with v050 pin; managed refresh refused correctly because this is not final unresolved leaf. Review the actual task_delta on its true base, do not pretend old-base full suite is current-main compatibility. Inspect interaction with adopted v060 Config/catalogue/cigate and state precise remaining integration validation; safe isolated composition probes may be used without modifying live worktree or managed checkpoints. Do not mutate .task-board or hand-rebase branch to solve it. Preserve accepted/checkpointed SSH/peer work. RPC partial15files parked and byte-verified; verify it is absent from credentials delta and evidence/recovery instructions remain attached to RPC task.\\n\\nProducer explicitly reports Windows owner-SID-only custody lacking DACL evidence; determine actual supported platform obligations and whether implementation meets them, not a blanket waiver. Secret census does not recognize LeafKeyDER/private-key.pem; inspect actual custody and replication reachability/negative tests and ownership evidence before accepting no-secret