al/unreadable/ambiguous/downgraded: store + preview +\\napply + rollback absent/corrupt/dup/legacy cases. No legacy fallback:\\nrequired transport, Migrate-v4-explicit, EncodeCurrent-v4 refusal, v3-reader\\nread-only. Enrollment/mapping/rotation/revocation/generation-auth: lifecycle\\n+ authorize tests. Owner-only atomic crash-durable writes: custody tests incl.\\nfault-seam commit failure, staging discipline, trust-commit recovery.\\nExact-preview migration + peer enrollment + durable apply/rollback: preview,\\napply, rollback tests. Preservation: full existing suites green unmodified +\\ninterop test. Platform/crash evidence: darwin 0700/0600/owner/symlink/fault\\ntests (this run). No secret replication: exclusion registry + walk test +\\ncensus rows + redaction tests.\\nStated bounds (not production-driven here): live TLS 1.3 launch/handshake/\\nhello/dispatch and stream close-down belong to the RPC transport task\\n(sections 11.10.1/11.10.4 transport gates); Windows DACL beyond owner-SID\\nequality has no runner here (code builds for windows, unix fully enforced);\\npeer-side distribution of enrollment/rotation/revocation is operator duty per\\nspec; server-flag refusals (no-host-channel) have no call site in this base.\\n\\n## Negative + mutation evidence (truthful counts)\\n\\n- hosttrust/mutations.py: 11 narrowing mutants killed by named tests, 1\\n  neutral SURVIVED control. config/mutations_v4.py: 3 narrowing + 1\\n  label-precision mutant killed, 1 neutral SURVIVED control.\\n- No gate searches source text for a token (all gates operate on decoded\\n  values/DER/parsed TOML), so the preserve-token behavioral-mutant clause is\\n  vacuous; stated here, not silently skipped.\\n- Evidence preserved: .temp/TASK-260909-2ez769/mutations-hosttrust/ and\\n  mutations-config/ (results.json, table.md, manifest.json with source\\n  digests and per-mutant exit/test lists).\\n- Gates: go build ./... ok; go vet ./... clean; gofmt clean;\\n  go test ./... -count=1 all ok;