{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000d7d7","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a08900-d199-7822-974c-1de7f95bc0fc"},"sequence":2630,"recorded_at":1780531400005255,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"0a8bdc02-b2cf-4bed-86b9-db3127962aef","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"0a8bdc02-b2cf-4bed-86b9-db3127962aef","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"0a8bdc02-b2cf-4bed-86b9-db3127962aef"},"call_id":"call_01a0891255cf7e63827f1bd358e69ac1","text":"Read text file `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.temp/STORY-260830-1kiyj6/worktree/LOGBOOK.md`.\n1|# Flight Logbook\n2|\n3|> Institutional memory. Concise, factual, high-signal.\n4|> Newest entries first. One block per insight.\n5|\n6|## 2026-09-10\n7|\n8|### TASK-260909-2ez769 — Host Trust Store 1.0.0 + Config 4.0.0 migration implemented\n9|- SCOPE: new `internal/hosttrust` (trust reader/writer, Profile-1 issuance/verify, custody, enroll/rotate/MarkRetiring/revoke, generation authz, export/exclusion); Config 4.0.0 reader/validator/encoder + Preview/Apply/Rollback in `internal/config`; v4 peeridentity interop test; secprim census extended to hosttrust.\n10|- FINDING: peer rotation catch-up had no local path (only self-rotation). Added `Store.MarkRetiring` with the same 24h/enrolled_at bounds. `ensureOwnerDir` verifies existing dirs, never repairs: silent narrowing masked a widened dir (caught by TestCustodyRefusals).\n11|- FINDING: Go x509 puts the CN ATV into Subject.Names (len 1), so CN-only means exactly one CN-OID ATV, not empty Names. Parsed-name check fixed in `profile_checks.go:subjectIsOnlyCN`.\n12|- FINDING: encoding/json decodes `\"1\"` into json.Number; generation now requires a bare JSON number. Duplicate JSON keys audited via token stream before decode.\n(more lines below)","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"read_file","outcome":"success"}}}
