g 4 killed + neutral passed, with refreshed `results.json`/`table.md`/`manifest.json`.\n\nUnchanged external blocker, restated in the outcome: CR validation command 21/26 needs adoption files absent on this story base, and `refresh-candidate` still refuses (\"requires the final unresolved leaf\"). No vendoring or manual rebase was done; rev3 will stop at command 21 until root/orchestrator resolves the base question.","reason":null}}
